      "text": "LLM Fundamentals",
      "hash": "a27078bfc6b5fd60b2c2ea51e3db5de7f1f14bf68278506ea5f18e4af3301a43"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea6954b186275cd86bff7240048b22cb52e7817c1c45d399c2dd805c3e19d04b",
      "text": "AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "29a768799acab15b5a0ee28f241b6e057d0b5ff706c70c3edf7f24676f3d77a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "a53879e2d8f4750c6ef49e2a177275c181ea6fd4b7422ed7729e0dc5b09c85d4",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "0dd927c39aa5024485bd6ec7ec477d3de10aa091934fff11b1555bc619f3b55d",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "95942904018484307d4ac7844e9d151746ce4e70b5c4d4e7979002516ac29b64",
      "text": "Failure Modes",
      "hash": "2330131b5d9793d4023783aeceb087c7880f12ec9aeb2d9334466709764226a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "be46a6a818dee8f5395f253577dfcc9d7e11e7ac299016f6ef9f697a2744915c",
      "text": "Attention relationship",
      "hash": "3326352af9343a5dd603549ddc399a87efaec24216defa5bbbf745688a6eb302"
    },
    {
      "id": "c31389278b462a4596b5904f530dcfe7d1c5bb11cefb37a55584027d6d64802a",
      "text": "The pairing between two tokens — meaningful pairs influence each other more than unrelated ones. A context of N tokens has ~N² of these.",
      "hash": "03fe1897b52bf66e386c04a4423768cc576e3260e3bd60e2f8ce1625a9205fd2"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f83901c198ee9405fb2d2627bedad3abf54603a44306b4f748a703c048d0db6",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "10a7cb3ef7cbca24d09f4cfaf78ba2dd74df878e141670f9d0487ae85c89deac",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae1f046c68e392dcb4e8a196b7a43b7bc56c677d68158b62e24ba76b790ce6f4",
      "text": "When predicting each",
      "hash": "be2623b91e2c638b8c253e555e735f7404f35e3994b4acdd1cadeb4feb21c678"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e83ae1ee9276dc5d8a0d82629216d8c8997fd42d74fac0809991c966872c919",
      "text": ", the",
      "hash": "3538a0b69856ece9aeb2961477bc2a6bbded4578906bc2df63533cdfa17b2bc4"
    },
    {
      "id": "117a2fbc197532ba76eb862a625181b10e732960a6794ab3ee366b0a25240215",
      "text": "factors in every other token in the",
      "hash": "10d8feb9a2870537bbf78e0564fd76b0b2bb18135f8cf65c096d6e7c16c343e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ff7c3076da5d8acba136cf12b2c8777d48c78f64c2d30df08971feb0db63742",
      "text": "— some heavily, others barely at all. The pairing between two tokens is an",
      "hash": "1ecdfc2baff25f20fbc9a84d047d18aa8b2d47b6c8102e8bad8aa5a6fdea7e05"
    },
    {
      "id": "959d33313ccf1080e59180a2b134fd08f7ad2c1cf71097c3f6dca1982621fedb",
      "text": "attention relationship",
      "hash": "346cd99c5f5c33f7a8954482ada5894a56359d28acaff746220c9f43977180c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "e59467d8c935593b482a65d3bd7ff21b2b4e4a52af2155a79304220f6c65212e",
      "text": ", and meaningful pairs (\"her\" with \"Sarah\", or a",
      "hash": "ea1e8af819a62f70d1436af468d9d535956dca374017048d832d1f5415bc1c28"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2bb42429b2e0333663432437c70407ce040cc9ec7d9eab75809810b3409e696",
      "text": "call with its",
      "hash": "d5e333980a16a33310b9e7b8033c49d141330e10b796cd4b497cf8367a5f1f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "f81a7e63c1837b3b8b7528bcbc718d3f4a4660a1dd0daf179e176077808e6f19",
      "text": "definition) influence each other more than unrelated ones. A context of N tokens has on the order of N² relationships.",
      "hash": "1e23ea823e4ba76314ce679bbe1f6869cd54fa0e0e9b6eb983376ef771ed6682"
    },
    {
      "id": "a73fd5fe9c47ff9df32be56b901072cb0becfac065f2c27edf812cf09c2eea35",
      "text": "The pairings are where the model's apparent understanding lives. When it resolves a pronoun, it's because the attention relationship between \"her\" and \"Sarah\" is strong. When it calls a function with the right arguments, the relationship between the call site and the definition it read earlier is doing the work. None of this is looked up — it's computed fresh on every",
      "hash": "fcf10275e657dd4951e025fdf7d7b5965c12ddee39364ae9c2ba95a072898a6c"
    },
    {
      "id": "8be429e0966c03fb79a9f4b16cb123b2cb9f4d0ab2e5d95ca2af804c7105677a",
      "text": "model provider request",
      "hash": "3004d539f1f0ae7a40070d95ba4a1323d874684827edf4d55b29a1056f8da7a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "937aaf50737469d9714895eaeb10a1699565a045d78de71905dd3e352e2a556e",
      "text": ", for every pair.",
      "hash": "0f66af5cbfc49e4995cc86bfec4f7ee36b0ede63321cca914756ae7da968ba27"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ea2cb25f925d6e9f7967bc74021e7086f36a7fef6cccf46d44db372ae843c92",
      "text": "The N² figure is worth sitting with, because it grows faster than intuition suggests:",
      "hash": "f2fc5d275d3d3cd383bef348e9ff400b5348ab28825a7559e8cb6e9dc608b9d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "0e419f41c7de58a096e944204f9df893c2b433822a1ead5c17c672247f6dab37",
      "text": "Context size",
      "hash": "a38d30047c4b5e09c5943050db14a018f1edb8f405a7c06b0a8996363d56e61a"
    },
    {
      "id": "d58036f0a90e5d4d5ce6d3fcdb55203d52c643f0549d380de06a6bc6a60fe3cf",
      "text": "Pairings (~N²)",
      "hash": "208768fcd985cbe1e1abd61f6cb729160b2ca587bfc87d87553d601f1982735c"
    },
    {
      "id": "f17e5ea5140abe32b82b8467ed434216f54a4308f8731429b006817881f8d9aa",
      "text": "1,000 tokens",
      "hash": "34c3b8569cac2616010df14ea5293cc7bc76276b117caf20178fb51a8a558934"
    },
    {
      "id": "d05f96da535486ae12e6f6021625e8763675ea55059b27b1fd6f7d66e6544f0a",
      "text": "~1 million",
      "hash": "15a9a9de2f72114e881e01b540a1093228321a45411700289a62351b8ec62639"
    },
    {
      "id": "609b9ccc46cae6d9e85e3cc4a6e7e59baff83ce5439539c0eff295e85a352d2d",
      "text": "10,000 tokens",
      "hash": "bd0e7a60d94ca60530c021bdfff782d82bfc852ffd01fa0b08885b1740ae6aea"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a9d5ebbc340dd9d802f980632f3ae3cd2fa4987415a81aa1b7908711a377fe0",
      "text": "~100 million",
      "hash": "b87a45e5b370a5b70b1861b2bf44b4dbadf8b6514d368a26433e9efd49509c3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f8d4ddec4d3fb4426390f4bf18beed8aeba65b6dba5dee87d371138a7451494",
      "text": "100,000 tokens",
      "hash": "a340a8e57b375dacc09b52395e64812f2ec1b9523b6968f4231107340c9eb08b"
    },
    {
      "id": "be7d810c7ff50aa08e2e1c8ea7a26601b139a1b77093f225fa274115dcd898d6",
      "text": "~10 billion",
      "hash": "6cd335c126e8d8fa55e8b58d6b80d8f7f34adae198f6267bf61b8c1569e0dfc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "aedab798246da16423c53a13c40ee08fa6c6b999f538a62ea02c36c52378802a",
      "text": "View Table",
      "hash": "aa0a0f6baf57a603925533ee10fab7f6bb4e7002e7d8df106b2bc671e1d72567"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e963ce6a75cf8f2f10646daa40af59babbe375c4b7d436ef33888fd281354a6",
      "text": "Each pairing is also computed more than once. Models have multiple attention heads — exact counts for frontier models are unpublished, but fifty to a hundred is a reasonable guess — and each head computes its own version of every relationship. So every pairing in the table above is duplicated across every head. That's a lot of pairings.",
      "hash": "de5f136f1ef162ccbd17c120a8a8f2bac624858f29bdcca273b97d66ca4b52f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "05589b8197177ea58c4a4cc6fa818ef7915ff5e604daeba6012a16788992f3a6",
      "text": "Only a small number of these relationships matter for any given task. The pairing between your instruction and the code it governs is one of a handful that count; almost everything else in the pool is noise. And the two grow at different rates: the relationships that matter stay roughly constant, while the total pool grows quadratically with context size. At 1,000 tokens, the pairing you care about is one in a million; at 100,000 tokens, it's one in ten billion. This is the arithmetic underneath the",
      "hash": "c094b106ce209acd0b6c22eac909f56258611de437bfe5da19f5c2b60e783d8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1301d975aebaaae2ddd0c1f5432637c1e4fab3d68789fce89fc2353397a3f0a",
      "text": "attention budget",
      "hash": "4f0ecd6ea97f18771cbd4203a929018449d8dbd4c6cce6f90fd7511b5c34cc81"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b319e0073f381f1410d2dc9fe4ff7f864785fecb569b4db419be630009a2a73",
      "text": ", and",
      "hash": "4aa9bfd2f175a94ad5a7cb321e1aea9790c73eb366a3415b47a00aeaa9fbf24a"
    },
    {
      "id": "942e23a164c62a955fb28860100ce15353ad03f4cee628b7cfcf084ae3b2de16",
      "text": "attention degradation",
      "hash": "79e5ddec1498a24115fe8cb565695632f5d9c71beafb43cd0a04d319ef44230f"
    },
    {
      "id": "cd54770fbcbe57308ce3dec5d81ca35821c4e15c1e84ecc4758199c4548aa669",
      "text": "is what it feels like when the relationships that matter get too thin a share.",
      "hash": "26b3b9fa61b11cab8d3e26c983c59767aaa54f8d483cb90c1cedcf0870d5ccea"
    },
    {
      "id": "2f09688339223f3cfa4f8915e7575e128bacafb2e60de5a5a2febe2b2133d023",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2688fc22d3b9ace4aa390f2f795b8c6b0b15919890c678375d37d2a3430dac4",
      "text": "\"It keeps confusing the two",
      "hash": "ca6f17c52d442f609e24daeca7381293dbd606e030ccd52bb8197d0894e1d000"
    },
    {
      "id": "f74fdaf774af30c85c4e4068b7e69a704130e541ed619416d05a5e861316bd1a",
      "text": "symbols across the diff — sounds like we're in the",
      "hash": "5e1a8ea301c79cf0643bc3257a2f0d109b60009b06a0c2b60e47c91c8144438c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1e1a46a8f8a17beecb0dc4eaab109aa1a3b06c78df48d5025f648e62e7d4da9",
      "text": "dumb zone",
      "hash": "d1f4ef2612da4453aa6dc92c0023b63f3efd20345f0715a9e437d9a08a5dbb8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7642fd6ab855753765519eb2e3c6e244ade4d1f5f381a17d4274ef617323915",
      "text": ".\"",
      "hash": "b5280e40c1282ec647256eb511128edaa5e24cae99d138b33ba72f8b2d678e37"
    },
    {
      "id": "39dc1c49fd9c8af529dcda20189200bffebae28c72c4fdf3f613333771721538",
      "text": "\"Yeah, the attention relationship between each call site and its declaration is fighting the other one — same token shape, different bindings. Rename one and the pairings sharpen.\"",
      "hash": "e725ba88d89c809df8cdea5860c42ff02c2ab4679f497dc69d08e4ac177f9a14"
    },
    {
      "id": "bda4840f91f96f087dbeef6ec01f5ba0bfffe968b9c98b278e614cba303f8f8e",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "38c2dcf27a9e980b715326a27ec5dd65dab1bab51e39b69341c8cecda5b4639f",
      "text": "Contextual knowledge",
      "hash": "d6e7abe0383292e093bb86c7be9c6e2a5572caca8fa0e5265c6f14c196b0bd4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "de5fa9e20a5b6d6684fa68018418947fb0f98d73db070b6759f7148428387c3f",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "67b0b20f202c200b2b044cbdba8715c9c9cc7af0a37598863f9410739027550a",
      "text": "Attention budget",
      "hash": "3050c3ed0aa7f513c8d6d6891433e8d97ad0fbe382486b1f5b52a1129c834ab1"
    },
    {
      "id": "66f0d84770bd0e89537b61a650f9eba25aadc6c92f12bb391582af0f3b30673c",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "0203fa2168ebf23165f770d72b92952a2d43b70d44c5feb743a5a4a6619eb261",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "833a2498dfcef111e752f0b4af461ca34f6bbc91dba2a451b547dedfcb231e86",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "b166694fdf88741d34d066fc690ed6e2749ce1c36adba43964c83773cff0c3b6",
      "text": "Email*",
      "hash": "61dff02026341a6e553a56fc2ba214a76ad68c18cc67bf732993cfdbd51bb8b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "7cd45ed9e29b740a2422e2bbe549f0a6c06050ef778e133a76311f13d204b98b",
      "text": "Get AI Hero updates",
      "hash": "81b46eab414c141d6dcd85a5bd534179bf54a3532469436d693c437e9de3a90a"
    },
    {
      "id": "cf0a9bc800302a0daa262a1476f347e6fa4f9c5390b4e36ccdd850602025c14d",
      "text": "No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.",
      "hash": "461f8758206b36fd4ddfaf6740b33dc0de41c9c7acb9121525993b781d5e18bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "58275c088f2704ef78433433f6f1c0481b3a033a88491e6f57577f2c09b3ec7f",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee9dc200797abfdc94e822f92fc85f6cd3e0fb470c8b1f36573d52269a859da4",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "3c4c572f61459153d6f79dc35c330d17af0c286ed8846c7b621b8099daef903c",
      "text": "Learn",
      "hash": "ce78afd0e6a225ecac96a6812b9d192e7eb35889cd5237beb38b50375b79d8dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "285164daac6980f60562c32883ed0e8875566c3469bd30751ebb9c349589d952",
      "text": "AI SDK v6 Crash Course",
      "hash": "71139c58dab0fc6fcc2f49d2d44fd5b7c9e9e6e7fbf043ec2f4b51758b1b82b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "92b5ff119271c7c2406f3de38a3bdbad833ccb384caa9caf91040b3a938bd37d",
      "text": "The AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "0ecca41f97662f50fc4210f00b4d05ed73257d862ecbd642b906cd7da42d4092"
    },
    {
      "id": "94c266b5ccd21e7caf562656921375c712dbc454ed49bb1d4eb3a07b1856e34a",
      "text": "Vercel AI SDK Tutorial",
      "hash": "2f2904108d573c969e5838280a3b2a087d103fdf0b462b1707035a6d6da2d62c"
